# Example environment variables.
#
# This file is a template. Copy it to a file named ".env" and fill in real
# values there. The real ".env" is never committed, so your secrets stay private.
#
# You don't need any of these to run the site as-is. Add them only when a
# feature asks for one (for example, an analytics ID or a form service key).
#
# Anything that the browser needs to see must start with PUBLIC_.
# Example:
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
